# Each request has a title on its ### line, which --name selects (case doesn't matter).

@BaseUrl=https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com

### List todos
GET {{BaseUrl}}/todos?_limit=3

### Create a todo
POST {{BaseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Try dotnet http-file",
    "completed": false
}

### Get the first todo
GET {{BaseUrl}}/todos/1
